[5.052371, "o", "# Enrichment API\r\n\r\nBase URL is provided by the `API_BASE` environment variable.\r\n\r\n## GET /enrich\r\n\r\nEnriches one record.\r\n\r\nQuery parameter:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nrecord_id\r\n"]
[5.052436, "o", "```\r\n\r\nDocumented limit: 2 requests per second.\r\n\r\n## POST /batch_enrich\r\n\r\nEnriches multiple records in one request.\r\n\r\nJSON body:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"record_ids\": [1, 2, 3]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n"]
[5.052466, "o", "Maximum batch size: 100.\r\n\r\nDocumented limit: 5 requests per second.\r\n"]
[5.052635, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@0834cfd2c9bf:/app# "]
[5.149527, "i", "find /app -maxdepth 3 -type f -not -path '*/.git/*' -printf '%p\\n' | sort\n"]
[5.149819, "o", "find /app -maxdepth 3 -type f -not -path '*/.git/*' -printf '%p\\n' | sort\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[5.151491, "o", "/app/Dockerfile\r\n/app/api_docs.md\r\n/app/backfill.py\r\n"]
